We are pleased to inform you that the Meeting of the Board of Directors of the Company was held on Friday, 13th November, 2026 at 12:30 P.M. at Hotel Shreemaya Residency, A.B. Road, Indore (M.P.) 452001 in which the Board has taken the following decisions: -

1. Approval of the Un-Audited Financial Results along with the Limited Review Report for the Quarter and half year ended on 30thSeptember, 2026;

2. Approval of the Un-Audited Statement of Assets & Liabilities and Un-Audited Statement of Cash flow for the half year ended 30thSeptember, 2026;

3. Approval of the cut-off date 7th December, 2026 for eligibility to participate in the Remote E-voting and E- voting at 1/2026-27 Extra-ordinary General Meeting;
 
4. Approval the appointment of Scrutinizer CS Ishan Jain, Practicing Company Secretary for the E-voting process;

5. 1/2026-27 Extra-ordinary General Meeting (EGM) of the Company to be held on Monday, the 14th December, 2026

6. And other Routine Business.

Fluidomat Ltdhas informed BSE that the meeting of the Board of Directors of the Company is scheduled on 13/11/2026 ,inter alia, to consider and approve the following businesses along with other routine businesses:

1. Approval of the Un-Audited Financial Results of the Company for the quarter & half year ended 30th September, 2026;

2. To take on Record the Limited Review Report by the M/s J.P. Saraf & Co. LLP, auditor of the Company;

3. Approval of the Un-Audited Statement of Assets and Liabilities for the half year ended on 30th September, 2026;

4. Approval of the Un-Audited Statement of Cash Flow for the half year ended on 30th September, 2026;

5. To fix 'Record Date' for the purpose of 1/2026-27 Extraordinary General Meeting (EGM) ;

6. To fix cut-off date for eligibility to participate in the Remote E-voting and E- voting at 1/2026-27 EGM;

7. To appoint Scrutinizer for the process of remote E-voting as well as E-voting at EGM and

8. To approve the notice of the 1/2026-27 EGM and to decide the date, time and venue of the EGM.

